# Environment files — secrets live in Vault, never in a committed file.
# Matched at any depth, and deliberately broad: a stray `.env.production` or
# `foo.env` must not become a paste-and-push. Examples stay tracked.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
!.env.template
.env.bak
.env.new
.env.old

